# The shop's welcome after a new game's first race (spec M5): new-game.scenario's licence
# and sign-up for the easy race, space ending the sign-up's wait, Return on the first
# race's help box, the race abandoned (Escape, Y), then Return every 3 s through the
# results, the shop's welcome and last place popups and on into the Underground Market.
# A shot every 200 ms from the abandon on; run with --no-ai.
